OL,3,GNEWSAMum's plea as rugby player missing
OL,4,Afor four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a British rugby union
OL,7,Fplayer who went missing during a trip
OL,8,Fto Spain has issued an emotional plea,
OL,9,Ffour years after he disappeared without
OL,10,Fa trace.
OL,12,FLevi Davis, who played for Bath Rugby
OL,13,Fas a winger before signing with Ealing
OL,14,Fand later moving to Worthing, was last
OL,15,Fseen leaving a pub in Barcelona on 29
OL,16,FOctober 2022, and was reported missing
OL,17,Fby his family a week later.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
