OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMum's plea as rugby player missing
OL,4,Afor four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis mother, Julie Davis from
OL,7,FBirmingham, said as a child Levi was a
OL,8,F"fun-loving, mischievous little boy"
OL,9,Fand that "light shone brightly"
OL,10,Fwhenever he would walk into any room.
OL,12,FMissing People charity is supporting
OL,13,Fthe family, a spokesperson said: "Levi,
OL,14,Fif you are reading this, please get in
OL,15,Ftouch."
